{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"halfling_iron_cap","model_identifier":"halfling_iron_cap","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"Iron cap for the halfling head (9 u): origin = slot_head (top centre of the head); one cube with helmet inflate 1.25 plus a knob.\n\n## Set notes (from the equipment folder)\n\n# halfling_equipment\n\nStandalone copies of the A1 halfling equipment (crude-but-honest bloom iron and wood). Same geometry as the gear baked into halfling_spearman / halfling_archer. One bbmodel per item; no clips.\n\n- `halfling_shortspear.bbmodel` (3 cubes): Shortspear, 1.6 m (57 u): bloom-iron leaf head, ash shaft. Grip at the origin (17 u from the butt), point 41 u forward (-Z). One-handed (with buckler); if held two-handed the second grip is 12 u forward of the main grip.\n- `halfling_shortsword.bbmodel` (4 cubes): Shortsword, blade 16 u (45 cm), total 22 u. Grip at the origin, blade forward (-Z), edges up/down. One-handed. A sheathed copy hangs at slot_hip_l on halfling_archer.\n- `halfling_shortbow.bbmodel` (6 cubes): Shortbow, 39 u (1.1 m). Held in slot_hand_l: grip at the origin, limbs along Z, string on the +Y side so it faces the archer when the bow is raised.\n- `halfling_buckler.bbmodel` (3 cubes): Buckler, about 30 cm (11 u) across, stepped round-ish planks with a bloom-iron boss. Gripped in the fist at slot_hand_l (origin = grip); face points -X with the arm hanging. Can also hang at slot_shield_l.\n- `halfling_iron_cap.bbmodel` (2 cubes): Iron cap for the halfling head (9 u): origin = slot_head (top centre of the head); one cube with helmet inflate 1.25 plus a knob.\n"},"description":"Iron cap for the halfling head (9 u): origin = slot_head (top centre of the head); one cube with helmet inflate 1.25 plus a knob.\n\n## Set notes (from the equipment folder)\n\n# halfling_equipment\n\nStandalone copies of the A1 halfling equipment (crude-but-honest bloom iron and wood). Same geometry as the gear baked into halfling_spearman / halfling_archer. One bbmodel per item; no clips.\n\n- `halfling_shortspear.bbmodel` (3 cubes): Shortspear, 1.6 m (57 u): bloom-iron leaf head, ash shaft. Grip at the origin (17 u from the butt), point 41 u forward (-Z). One-handed (with buckler); if held two-handed the second grip is 12 u forward of the main grip.\n- `halfling_shortsword.bbmodel` (4 cubes): Shortsword, blade 16 u (45 cm), total 22 u. Grip at the origin, blade forward (-Z), edges up/down. One-handed. A sheathed copy hangs at slot_hip_l on halfling_archer.\n- `halfling_shortbow.bbmodel` (6 cubes): Shortbow, 39 u (1.1 m). Held in slot_hand_l: grip at the origin, limbs along Z, string on the +Y side so it faces the archer when the bow is raised.\n- `halfling_buckler.bbmodel` (3 cubes): Buckler, about 30 cm (11 u) across, stepped round-ish planks with a bloom-iron boss. Gripped in the fist at slot_hand_l (origin = grip); face points -X with the arm hanging. Can also hang at slot_shield_l.\n- `halfling_iron_cap.bbmodel` (2 cubes): Iron cap for the halfling head (9 u): origin = slot_head (top centre of the head); one cube with helmet inflate 1.25 plus a knob.\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"iron_cap","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4.5,-2.5,-4.5],"to":[4.5,0.0,4.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":1.25,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[18,0,27.0,2.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,9,9.0,11.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[9,9,18.0,11.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[18,9,27.0,11.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,9.0,9.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[9,0,18.0,9.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"4ed81701-d24c-5db2-9e6f-a4d0c19b2bcf"},{"name":"cap_knob","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.0,1.25,-1.0],"to":[1.0,2.25,1.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,12,2.0,13.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[2,12,4.0,13.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[4,12,6.0,13.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[6,12,8.0,13.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[27,9,29.0,11.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[29,9,31.0,11.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"1d1c28e4-cb8a-5e2d-9cdb-4af84a7e0d7f"}],"outliner":[{"name":"halfling_iron_cap","origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"color":0,"uuid":"68c069dc-5971-5a25-aa30-a4abc030eb0d","export":true,"mirror_uv":false,"isOpen":true,"locked":false,"visibility":true,"autouv":0,"rotation":[0,0,0],"children":["4ed81701-d24c-5db2-9e6f-a4d0c19b2bcf","1d1c28e4-cb8a-5e2d-9cdb-4af84a7e0d7f"]}],"textures":[{"path":"halfling_iron_cap.png","name":"halfling_iron_cap.png","folder":"","namespace":"","id":"0","width":32,"height":32,"uv_width":32,"uv_height":32,"particle":false,"use_as_default":true,"layers_enabled":false,"sync_to_project":"","render_mode":"default","render_sides":"auto","frame_time":1,"frame_order_type":"loop","frame_order":"","frame_interpolate":false,"visible":true,"internal":true,"saved":true,"uuid":"d2753008-18f8-5696-ba5e-767aa2a54626","relative_path":"halfling_iron_cap.png","source":"data:image/png;base64,"}],"animations":[]}